$ .<= must be a total order on the abstract value, whichever representations the two
$ sides happen to get (they may differ, and the orderings the representations define
$ are not comparable with each other). There are 3**2 = 9 partial functions on 2
$ points, so exactly 9*10/2 = 45 of the 9*9 pairs satisfy a .<= b -- in every model.
letting e be new type of size 2

find a : function e --> e
find b : function e --> e

such that a .<= b
